{"id":"ley","lemma":"ley","pos":"noun","rank":585,"glosses":["law (a well-established characteristic of nature)","law (body of rules issued by a legislative body)","law (particular piece of legislation)"],"ipa":"/ˈlei/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"leyes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-ley.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es lo que dice la ley.","en":"That's the law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568396","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"Las leyes han cambiado.","en":"The laws have changed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460937","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"changed"}]},{"text":"Es una ley estúpida.","en":"It's a stupid law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443503","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"stupid","l":"estúpido"}]},{"text":"Estoy en contra de este proyecto de ley.","en":"I'm against the bill.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800788","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"project, plan"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[1,4,"against"]]},{"text":"Tom decidió estudiar leyes.","en":"Tom decided to study law.","words":[null,{"g":"to decide","l":"decidir"},{"g":"to study"},null]}]}